Package: usb-x
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: USB X Team <support@usb-x.org>
Description: High-performance, lightweight bootable USB drive creator
 Fast and reliable bootable USB formatting and image flasher inspired
 by Rufus, supporting Windows 10/11 with autounattend bypass, Linux
 ISOHybrid, and raw disk images.

